      "text": "Sanskrit      Military unit       Modern chess piece\n─────────     ─────────────       ──────────────────\nRaja          King (elephant)     King\nMantri        Counsellor          Queen (originally)\nHasti         War elephant        Bishop\nAshva         Horse               Knight\nRatha         Chariot             Rook\nPadati        Foot soldier        Pawn"
