        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The dice version is thought to be earlier (gambling tradition); the two-player version represents abstraction — removing randomness to create a pure strategy game. This is a historically rare transformation: games almost never remove randomness, as chance maintains player engagement for weaker players."
    },
